            <div xml:id="d723">

                <pb facs="0952" n="850" xml:id="pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/2045: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gilbert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-10-22T18:00:00+01:00">October 22, 1935—6
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 22—12:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>539. Delegation’s 338, October 21, 8 p.m. I am informed by the Secretariat that
                    this communication is also being sent to the following states: Germany, Saudi
                    Arabia, Brazil, Costa Rica, Danzig, Egypt, Iceland, Japan, Liechtenstein,
                    Monaco.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gilbert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
